					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_QUEST_NOT_RECEIVE",
						"rawParams": [
							"7223708",
							"1"
						]
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"安贞"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 722370401,
					"content": "我听闻鸣神岛的使节谈到过鸟这种生物。有翅膀，能够在高天里飞翔。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722370402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安贞"
				},
				{
					"id": 722370402,
					"content": "太梦幻了，你们可以想象吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722370403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安贞"
				},
				{
					"id": 722370403,
					"content": "也有人认为，它们是神明的使者，会特地前来传达人的命运。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722370404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安贞"
				},
				{
					"id": 722370404,
					"content": "如果有人因为流放之罚而最终曝尸荒野的话，同一种鸟还会过来啄食他的凡躯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722370405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安贞"
				},
				{
					"id": 722370405,
					"content": "我对这种生灵很着迷。如果今天以后，还有机会见到天光，我一定要养一只鸟。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "安贞"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7223705,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7223708
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7223708",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7223708,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"安贞"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 722370501,
					"content": "你们拿到书了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722370502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安贞"
				},
				{
					"id": 722370502,
					"content": "拿到了。安贞你确实是无辜的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722370503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 722370503,
					"content": "从刚才的话来看，你们并不是地走官，有点可惜。不然就能现场正式承认我的无罪了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722370504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安贞"
				},
				{
					"id": 722370504,
					"content": "不然就能立刻证明我的清白了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722370505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安贞"
				},
				{
					"id": 722370505,
					"content": "我现在感觉非常精神，但是之前那种流血过多的疲倦感也很真实。我是不是真的快要死了所以回光返照啊？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722370506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安贞"
				},
				{
					"id": 722370506,
					"content": "唔…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722370507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 722370507,
					"content": "唉，我问你啊，陌生人。被白夜国所判的冤罪，是罪孽吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722370508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安贞"
				},
				{
					"id": 722370508,
					"content": "…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722370509
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722370509,
					"content": "如果此刻的我，因为这种难以平复的心境，被常世大神留为罪影。这是罪孽吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722370510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安贞"
				},
				{
					"id": 722370510,
					"content": "我，有罪吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722370511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安贞"
				},
				{
					"id": 722370511,
					"content": "你没有罪。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722370512
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722370512,
					"content": "#喂，{NICKNAME}，你要小心点说话。让他意识到了…意识到那件事的话，他会消失的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722370513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 722370513,
					"content": "你只是安贞留下的残影。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722370514
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722370514,
					"content": "…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722370515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安贞"
				},
				{
					"id": 722370515,
					"content": "你是无罪的，我会让所有人知道。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722370516
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722370516,
					"content": "哼哼，是吗。原来我只是生前的一个影子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722370517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安贞"
				},
				{
					"id": 722370517,
					"content": "原来，我是无罪的啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "安贞"
				},
				{
					"id": 722370518,
					"content": "安贞的残影开始背诵断章——\\n「我究竟触犯了哪一条神律…不幸的人为什么要仰仗神明？\\n我的作为是否有意义，既然我的虔诚之行换取了负罪之名？」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "安贞"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}